Bundled fonts — licence status
==============================

This directory ships four woff2 files, redistributed with the project and
referenced by templates/cv-template.html, resume-template.html and
cv-template.zh-minimal.html:

  dm-sans-latin.woff2 / dm-sans-latin-ext.woff2
  space-grotesk-latin.woff2 / space-grotesk-latin-ext.woff2

DM Sans and Space Grotesk are both published under the SIL Open Font License
1.1, which permits bundling, modification and commercial use — including in a
paid product.

⚠️ OUTSTANDING: the OFL requires that a copy of the licence accompany the fonts
wherever they are redistributed. No licence text ships here. That gap is
inherited from upstream, but it becomes this project's responsibility the moment
these files are redistributed under its name — and materially so if Jobsmith is
ever sold or offered as a paid service.

To close it, copy the OFL text from each font's own repository into this
directory (do not transcribe it from memory — the licence must be verbatim):

  DM Sans        https://github.com/googlefonts/dm-fonts
  Space Grotesk  https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk

Note: templates/cv-template.html currently sets a system font stack
("Liberation Sans", Helvetica Neue, Arial, DejaVu Sans) for ATS text-extraction
reasons, so these faces may not be doing much work. If they turn out to be
unused, deleting them removes the obligation entirely — the simpler fix.
